 kids they could  give one child the stark name and the  other child the Targaryen name you could  essentially kill two birds with one  stone  even if Daenerys doesn't have twins her  and John could always have more children  later as soon as John finds out she's  pregnant he's gonna want to marry her  because he doesn't want to father a  bastard  as long as neither of these characters  die I think they will continue what  their relationship which means they  could have several children and give  them whatever name they please now if  Sansa Arya or even brain had a kid then  they could save their house on their own  and John wouldn't be needed for that at  all but until that happens John seems  like the man for the job  since the bail the bards story has so  many parallels to John's own birth it  feels like John would be the one to  repeat history from that story by being  the bastard who saves House Stark I  should have clarified that in the video  but I didn't want to ramble too long so  I didn't mention the fact that I believe  Daenerys could have several kids and  potentially save two major houses by  doing so that's what I really meant by  that so hopefully that answers your  question anyways I want to thank  everyone for watching today's video I  really appreciate that I also want to  thank all of my patreon supporters  all of you have given me a tremendous  amount of help during the off season and  I cannot thank you enough for that I  hope everyone has a great day and I will  see you in the next video bye  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]
 

